```c
if (idn2_to_unicode_lzlz(domain, &out, 0) == IDN2_OK)
    idn2_free(out);
```

This calls `idn2_to_unicode_lzlz` -> `idn2_to_unicode_8zlz` -> `idn2_to_unicode_8z8z` -> `idn2_to_unicode_8z4z`.

And:
```c
if ((size & 3) == 0) {
    uint32_t *u32 = (uint32_t *) malloc(size);
    ...
    u32len = size / 4;
    idn2_to_unicode_44i((uint32_t *) data, size / 4, u32, &u32len, 0);
    ...
}
```

